        "node_id": "n_10_7e76fc",
        "thought_text": "Consider a different approach where we directly attempt to find the values of a_1, a_2, a_3, b_1, b_2, b_3 by solving the system of equations formed by the grid. This can be done using matrix operations or linear algebra libraries.",
