        "node_id": "n_11_dd5768",
        "thought_text": "Instead of calculating differences, try to validate the grid by checking if each cell value can be expressed as a sum of corresponding a_i and b_j. Iterate through all possible combinations of a_i and b_j within the constraints and see if they satisfy the grid conditions.",
